abstract: >
  Event-sourced server kernel published as Vesta, package version 4.8.2.
  A product pins one commit. Since 3.0.0 the default bus is Redis Streams;
  Pub/Sub is selected only with EVENT_BUS_TRANSPORT=pubsub. Since 4.0.0 the
  sales, HR, healthcare, research, and x402 domains stay off unless
  MODULE_<NAME>_ENABLED is true. Delivery to another system is at least once,
  with the limits in docs/claims.md claim C5. A tool body that requires
  approval does not run until that call carries an approval grant. Cite the
  pinned commit and docs/claims.md. This file is not a measurement of model quality.
